==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*8 [[Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*6 [[Doge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*4 [[Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Sunrise Doge]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use cheap cats because [[Sunrise Doge]] is considered a metal enemy. Using cats like Cow Cat and its variants is a very good strategy but don't save up for anything that does crits, it's not worth it for the time.

